ication"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id526292412"}, "name": {"label": "tarwindersingh"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2026-09-08T05:49:33-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "2"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.8.8"}, "id": {"label": "14525151784"}, "title": {"label": "Problem"}, "content": {"label": "On my iPhone 17 pro max game is not starting. Window pop up for a second and again starts loading", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1333476679&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1020619659"}, "name": {"label": "Xndkbdosnd"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2026-08-23T02:39:39-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.8.3"}, "id": {"label": "14461933166"}, "title": {"label": "Djdbc"}, "content": {"label": "Dbisbds", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1333476679&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id621958332"}, "name": {"label": "Jest1233"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2026-08-22T02:34:30-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "1"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.8.3"}, "id": {"label": "14458057349"}, "title": {"label": "Worst game"}, "content": {"label": "Its keep on downloading always", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1333476679&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1061711722"}, "name": {"label": "He\u2019ll it is"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2026-08-15T02:13:44-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "1"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.7.8"}, "id": {"label": "14430065263"}, "title": {"label": "A really bad game"}, "content": {"label": "Goddamn I don\u2019t get any money and instead of giving me money they steal it for no reason like I had made 100,440 money and when I came back to the game it was 91,000 money this a terrible game", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1333476679&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id899554876"}, "name": {"label": "cefence"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2026-08-09T06:17:05-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "1"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.7.8"}, "id": {"label": "14406589013"}, "title": {"label": "Extremely frustrating and feels deliberately designed to waste your time"}, "content": {"label": "I\u2019ve been playing Airline Commander for a while, and the money/reward system is honestly one of the most frustrating things I\u2019ve experienced in a mobile game.\n\nThere is a serious glitch with the in-game money. After completing regular objectives, the game shows that I\u2019ve earned and collected the money, but the amount doesn\u2019t actually get added to my account. Sometimes the balance is different every time I reopen the game, which makes it impossible to know whether the money I earned is actually being saved.\n\nWhat makes it worse is how unnecessarily long and complicated the process of earning money is. You spend a lot of time completing objectives, watch ads or go through different steps to collect rewards, and then the money either doesn\u2019t appear or the balance suddenly changes.\n\nAt this point, it genuinely feels like the game is designed to make it as difficult as possible for players to earn enough money to progress. Even when you finally manage to earn a decent amount, the game seems to find a way to reduce or lose it.\n\nNew players should seriously think twice before downloading this game. The gameplay itself can be enjoyable, but the broken reward system and constant money issues completely ruin the experience. Developers really need to fix the economy, properly save player balances, and stop making players feel like their progress is being taken away.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1333476679&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id559178173"}, "name": {"label": "aman9867"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2026-08-07T21:34:59-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "1"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.7.8"}, "id": {"label": "14401501004"}, "title": {"label": "Full of advertisment, you feel stuck after certain point"}, "content": {"label": "The app is full of advertisments,\nYou cannot fly bcoz you dpnt have license or you dont have plane..\n\nHow to get that increase level and get..\n\nHow to increase level?\nFly or see advertisments to generate game credits so that you can earn money to buy a plane", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1333476679&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"au