iews/id1918100105"}, "name": {"label": "Shubh355"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2026-05-03T23:42:24-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "2"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.7.0"}, "id": {"label": "14026424545"}, "title": {"label": "Slow progress"}, "content": {"label": "It\u2019s been a very long time I am playing this game. Overall experience with the game is very good like we have lots of aircrafts, different type of emergencies, licenses, various routes and all that. But the problem is the game progress is very slow I mean it takes a lot of time to earn money and apply for licenses, even in daily events we can not fly more if we don\u2019t have money like we have to add real money to the game for better experience. The whole game is relied on slow progress model in which we can not go further without spending a bunch of time in a specific point. Sometime I think that I am not playing the game, the game is controlled by the developers all the time. Please fix these things If you can.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1333476679&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1526253617"}, "name": {"label": "Shh_GameTester"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2026-04-15T06:59:03-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "1"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.6.9"}, "id": {"label": "13960547820"}, "title": {"label": "Game isn\u2019t even launching on my phone"}, "content": {"label": "Game isn\u2019t even launching on my phone", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1333476679&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:vo